MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR TUI_OS (VAULT WORLDWIDE):
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.
Product truth: PRODUCT.md. Visual system after build: DESIGN.md.

This is one continuous personal OS field — not a dashboard, not stacked sections.
No cards, rounded corners, soft shadows, section billboards, DateBlocks, or teal watermarks.

PALETTE: Paper #F4F4F0 (sheet, `INV` default) · Field #000000 (ink, organ plates) · Power red #E10600.
Power red = oval, caret, live ticks, `[+]` / shovel, strike / URGENT.
One accent. Cobalt has left.

TYPE: Oswald 700 on plaques. Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial on work. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk.

COMPOSITION (desktop field, not a PWA, not mobile-first):
1. Paper sheet. Organs are black 1px windows (`PLACE`). Title bar, Oswald plaque, `[x] ···`, tick ruler, octagon counts. Grain / scan / oval are SPECK.
2. One work graph. NEST is the tree. PIPE is the same nodes by status (FOCUS | GATEWAY). Empty ledger rows stay and create. HIT a task expands in place — rows below move down. Oval + CHIP, not overlay dossier.
3. Click-and-type on the cell. TAB cycles title → body → subtask → status. Dock is operator (commands + dump). Legend rail above it toggles GRAIN / SCAN / INV. Never a second input.
4. SHOVEL / status puts a node on the binder. `[+]` adds a child. CLIP-copy is dead.
5. Salt organs SEAL / SKULL / CAL are PLACE-able, not identity. CAL is a month window, not month-as-OS home.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks cards, jagged day cards, SaaS kanban cards, amber theme, JSON-as-database, second prompt, cobalt lash.
Do not revive beige cassette as the OS identity, month-as-OS as home, todo nest, or a Tailwind binder.
